{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインデー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でしたね～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしいチョッコレート皆は食べた？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはね…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１個も作れなかった。あっちゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそのくせ学校の友達も\n乃木坂メンバーもたっくさ～んくれたよ～？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分ねあみのお腹の中６割マフィン４割クッキーだった気が……。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘いもんばっか摂取したから\nチョコレートの女王様になった気分だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｴﾍ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて～と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"刻一刻と迫ってきてますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビュー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週の水曜日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうなるんだろあみ達。\nなんかねまだ想像出来ないの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これでもっと世に羽ばたける～！！っていう期待もあれば…\n不安もある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも早くたっくさんの人に\n『ぐるぐるカーテン』聞いて欲しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/delicious.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ達の存在を知って欲しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…そう思います。\n高２の春。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/16/120216_171101.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}